@startuml UC-07 接诊与拒诊
actor 医生
boundary "医生工作台接口" as DoctorWorklistController
control "问诊订单服务" as ConsultationOrderAppService
entity "问诊订单仓储" as OrderRepository
医生 -> DoctorWorklistController : 提交接诊决定（动作、理由、版本号）
DoctorWorklistController -> ConsultationOrderAppService : 处理接诊决定
ConsultationOrderAppService -> OrderRepository : 查询订单
ConsultationOrderAppService -> ConsultationOrderAppService : 校验医生归属和待接诊状态
alt 接诊
  ConsultationOrderAppService -> OrderRepository : 更新为问诊中
else 拒诊
  ConsultationOrderAppService -> ConsultationOrderAppService : 校验拒诊理由
  ConsultationOrderAppService -> OrderRepository : 更新为已取消并标记待退款
end
ConsultationOrderAppService --> DoctorWorklistController : 返回处理结果或错误
@enduml
